      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRONZE (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (26.24) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Ballarat. Can make amends this time. TURN UP TURBO (7) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 26.25. Wide box to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Should be in this for a long way. OFF THE BEER (6) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 26.19. Jumping from the pinch draw but has a good record over this journey. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. VOLTAGE STRIKE (8) returns here as an each-way chance.",
